  "_notes": {
    "units": "game units (0.72 of real size); +Y muzzle; held like a pistol, so modelled upside down as GoM's handgun-held guns are: +Z the gun's BOTTOM, +X its RIGHT; origin = rear-top of grip (photo L 289, H 91.5)",
