    "turned": "parts modelled upright (magazines, GoM optics / lights / lasers) get rotate -180 0 -180, as on GoM's MP5K; render_mp7.py / make_mp7_art.py turn everything back for display",
    "magazine": "magazine meshes hang straight down from the feed lips inside the grip and curve toward the muzzle below it (30 / 40 rounds), modelled upright",
    "canon": "the nose plate's face where the barrel leaves it; MP7_Muzzle_Mount_Device and MP7_Suppressor have their origin there and extend along +Y over the flash hider",
    "bolt_fired": "charging handle pulled back 50 mm real; the real MP7 handle does not reciprocate",
    "stock_folded": "MP7A1_STOCK is modelled extended; this offset slides it in (223 mm real)",
